    {
      "id": "yr1KLmmf7Fu8WEZTjhBFU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 605.4609375,
      "y": 153.71875,
      "width": 744.799560546875,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 156786526,
      "version": 853,
      "versionNonce": 497651458,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775227073854,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements\n- Chat server\n- Redis\n- MongoDB (transcripts)\n- AWS SQS (process the transcripts)\n- Admin can request for all the transcripts\n- As I am chatting, CSR, customer, \n- Intelligent helper for our system\n- Problems with delivery, refunds, \n- want to cancel my order\n\n- Build AI System (read about such requests)\n- Prompt solution to Customer\n\n- KBs articles\n- Suggest Multiple links to Agents\n- Browser links and send suggestions to customer\n- Store the insights\n- In Real time\n- Scale to millions of users\n- Async processing to support these requests\n\n- AI Agent (it has all the repositories)\n- Human Agent (Ask the help to AI system)\n\n- Do you want AI continously helping human agent or only human will require?\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements\n- Chat server\n- Redis\n- MongoDB (transcripts)\n- AWS SQS (process the transcripts)\n- Admin can request for all the transcripts\n- As I am chatting, CSR, customer, \n- Intelligent helper for our system\n- Problems with delivery, refunds, \n- want to cancel my order\n\n- Build AI System (read about such requests)\n- Prompt solution to Customer\n\n- KBs articles\n- Suggest Multiple links to Agents\n- Browser links and send suggestions to customer\n- Store the insights\n- In Real time\n- Scale to millions of users\n- Async processing to support these requests\n\n- AI Agent (it has all the repositories)\n- Human Agent (Ask the help to AI system)\n\n- Do you want AI continously helping human agent or only human will require?\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
